      "writtenOn": "2019-04-04T17:22:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I can\u0027t make sense of this. p9221_notifier_check_det calls p9221_set_online then calls p9221_vbus_check_timeout_defer. Why are we setting it offline?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 707,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 709,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "5da2532da621ab67f9b7a8c0ac4b6ac8ac684428",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4c453312_27919d95",
        "filename": "driver/wpc/p9221.c",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 709,
      "author": {
        "id": 1311150
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-04-09T02:49:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we attach the TX with RX, and soon detach the TX before VBUS is on, there wpc will be set online, and keep online in driver forever. so set offline if VBUS timeout, and if VBUS come in,\nset wpc online.",
      "parentUuid": "68a4240c_f4ed692d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 707,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 709,
        "endChar": 0
